# ==============================================================================
# Nostromo PostgreSQL Connection Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to a new file named '.env' in this same project directory:
#      Copy-Item .env.example .env
# 2. Paste the exact PostgreSQL connection URI provided by your Nostromo Android app below.
# 3. Do not quote or modify the URI unless instructed by Nostromo.
#
# URI Format:
#   DATABASE_URL=postgresql://<username>:<password>@<host>:<port>/<database_name>
#
# Examples:
#   - Direct Wi-Fi connection (PC and Android on the same Wi-Fi network):
#     DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:mysecretpassword@192.168.1.105:5432/nostromodb
#
#   - USB Cable with ADB reverse/forward (run `adb forward tcp:5432 tcp:5432` first):
#     DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:mysecretpassword@127.0.0.1:5432/nostromodb
#
# ==============================================================================
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:nostromo@127.0.0.1:5432/test_user_db"
